units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 2 single 2.0 2.0 0.0
create_atoms 2 single 2.0 6.0 0.0
create_atoms 2 single 6.0 2.0 0.0
create_atoms 2 single 6.0 6.0 0.0
create_atoms 1 single 2.0 2.0 3.5
create_atoms 1 single 2.0 6.0 3.5
create_atoms 1 single 6.0 2.0 3.5
create_atoms 1 single 6.0 6.0 3.5
mass 1 39.948
mass 2 196.9665
group wall type 2
group fluid type 1
velocity fluid create 200.0 99 dist gaussian mom yes rot no units box
velocity wall set 0.0 0.0 0.0 units box
pair_style lj/cut 8.0
pair_coeff * * 0.010341 3.4
neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
fix 1 all nve
fix 2 wall setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0
thermo 0
run 20000
